  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Speech Bubbles are a great feature, but the issue here is where the focus is directed. If you direct someone's visual attention away from the avatar itself, it can lead you to miss key moments in a conversation. It should be considered an option to give Text input \"Subtitle\" positioning, where it appears from around the chest/midsection area. This way, you don't miss anything important. See KillfrenzyAvatarText for examples.",
